{"id": "city-rents-from-landlords-in-foreclosure", "title": "Two City leases approved after lenders recorded default notices", "seconds": 70.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "6153a1c02f6de42d", "words": 210, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "Lenders recorded default notices before the City approved leases on two buildings.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.41, "shot": "1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Two City leases", "sub": "141 Industrial Street and Innes Avenue"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.91, 1.3, 1.79, 2.1, 2.23, 2.49, 2.86, 3.28, 3.43, 3.65]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["amount", "established[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "The first year of rent on those leases came to 982,800 dollars.", "t0": 4.53, "t1": 9.25, "shot": "2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Lease approvals", "heading": "First-year rent", "source": "b240566", "rows": [{"icon": "lease", "label": "141 Industrial Street", "value": "$351,000"}, {"icon": "lease", "label": "Innes Avenue", "value": "$631,800"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 0.58, 0.7, 1.0, 1.14, 1.39, 1.81, 2.07, 2.22, 2.48, 2.8, 3.26, 3.7, 3.91, 4.18]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Whether public money or space was lost is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 9.37, "t1": 12.95, "shot": "3", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Rent and improvements", "Continued occupancy"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.7, 0.99, 1.14, 1.43, 1.61, 2.02, 2.18, 2.28, 2.86, 3.06, 3.15]}, {"scene": "industrial", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "At 141 Industrial Street, a notice of trustee sale was already recorded in January 2024.", "t0": 13.17, "t1": 19.82, "shot": "5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rec25", "kicker": "San Francisco Assessor-Recorder", "text": "141 Industrial Street · January 2024", "mark": "141 Industrial Street · January 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.4, 0.84, 1.34, 2.27, 2.47, 2.87, 3.02, 3.56, 3.91, 4.09, 4.44, 4.95, 5.13, 5.69, 6.02]}, {"scene": "industrial", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The City approved a lease at 351,000 dollars a year that July.", "t0": 19.94, "t1": 24.15, "shot": "6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$351,000", "label": "first-year rent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.41, 0.8, 0.89, 1.23, 1.41, 1.7, 2.0, 2.46, 2.78, 3.05, 3.14, 3.37, 3.55]}, {"scene": "industrial", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Section 11 protects the City’s occupancy when the senior lender accepts the lease conditions.", "t0": 24.27, "t1": 28.96, "shot": "7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "lease11", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "Section 11", "mark": "Section 11"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.8, 1.21, 1.33, 1.65, 2.24, 2.42, 2.53, 2.84, 3.11, 3.47, 3.59, 3.81]}, {"scene": "industrial", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[0]", "timeline[4]", "timeline[11]"], "text": "The lender took the property in November 2025.", "t0": 29.08, "t1": 31.77, "shot": "8", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "timeline", "context": "141 Industrial Street", "heading": "From notice to trustee’s deed", "source": "rec25", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Notice of default", "event": "2023-10-30"}, {"icon": "vote", "label": "City lease approved", "event": "2024-07-12"}, {"icon": "lease", "label": "Trustee’s deed", "event": "2025-11-14"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.42, 0.61, 0.71, 1.13, 1.26, 1.7, 1.98]}, {"scene": "innes", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[5]"], "text": "At Innes Avenue, first-year rent was 631,800 dollars.", "t0": 31.99, "t1": 36.93, "shot": "10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$631,800", "label": "first-year rent at Innes Avenue"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.48, 1.48, 1.98, 2.57, 2.8, 3.03, 3.28, 3.71, 4.07, 4.23, 4.46]}, {"scene": "innes", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "The default notice preceded introduction of the lease by 53 days.", "t0": 37.05, "t1": 40.9, "shot": "11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rec25", "kicker": "San Francisco Assessor-Recorder", "text": "Notice recorded 53 days before introduction", "mark": "Notice recorded 53 days before introduction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.54, 0.88, 1.39, 1.91, 2.02, 2.13, 2.4, 2.6, 3.17]}, {"scene": "innes", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[4]", "timeline[7]", "timeline[9]", "timeline[10]"], "text": "Both notices of default were later rescinded.", "t0": 41.02, "t1": 43.67, "shot": "12", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "timeline", "context": "Innes Avenue", "heading": "Notice and lease approval", "source": "b250872", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Notice of default", "event": "2025-07-11"}, {"icon": "lease", "label": "Lease introduced", "event": "2025-09-02"}, {"icon": "vote", "label": "Lease approved", "event": "2025-10-06"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.8, 0.92, 1.38, 1.56, 1.85]}, {"scene": "other", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "At 752 Vallejo Street, the landlord lost the building to a lender in 2025.", "t0": 43.89, "t1": 49.5, "shot": "14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "752 Vallejo Street", "sub": "Trustee’s deed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.51, 1.02, 1.46, 2.48, 2.64, 3.1, 3.4, 3.51, 3.85, 3.98, 4.06, 4.4, 4.51, 4.86]}, {"scene": "other", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "At 1155 Market, the default came in the last fiscal year with recorded rent.", "t0": 49.62, "t1": 55.69, "shot": "15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "1155 Market Street", "sub": "2024 default notice"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.43, 0.87, 1.03, 1.38, 1.97, 2.81, 2.97, 3.43, 3.68, 3.76, 3.88, 4.13, 4.51, 4.96, 5.22, 5.7]}, {"scene": "other", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "At 144 Eddy Street, the default notice followed the original lease term.", "t0": 55.81, "t1": 59.85, "shot": "16", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rec25", "kicker": "San Francisco Assessor-Recorder", "text": "144 Eddy Street · June 2025", "mark": "144 Eddy Street · June 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.41, 0.96, 1.19, 1.78, 1.93, 2.31, 2.62, 2.94, 3.06, 3.45, 3.7]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The index records filing dates. It cannot tell us what the Board knew.", "t0": 60.07, "t1": 63.97, "shot": "18", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["What the City knew", "Whether any occupancy was lost"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.58, 0.94, 1.36, 2.08, 2.27, 2.6, 2.87, 3.0, 3.18, 3.3, 3.6]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "The lender agreements would help answer whether the City could keep using each building.", "t0": 64.09, "t1": 67.86, "shot": "19", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Which protections did lenders accept?"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.48, 0.87, 1.03, 1.24, 1.56, 1.84, 1.96, 2.23, 2.4, 2.65, 2.95, 3.17]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 67.98, "t1": 69.94, "shot": "20", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.39, 0.49, 0.58, 1.01, 1.19, 1.29]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Default notices", "industrial": "141 Industrial Street", "innes": "Innes Avenue", "other": "Other leases", "close": "What the records show"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "timeline"}